<li>Psychic Detective: A Spiritual Investigation Into Unsolved Crimes, Scott Russell-Hill, McMillan Press,</li>
<li>Unsolved Murders in New Zealand, Tory Williams, Griffen Pers, Sydney, 1999,</li>
